Package: becasso
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Layer-based graphics editor for V\OS
 Becasso is a paint and imaging program with layers, selections, brush
 and shape tools, plug-in filter add-ons and palettes.
